{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/extras/e11b3f56b2d4b2ea43d4ad19d0ec4652.avif?t=1749491697\" width=600 height=210 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An explosive physics-based platformer.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the challenging dynamite-based movement used as a last resort for your poor little goblin friend to discover the truth of this world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A combination of speed and accuracy.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Goblomite timing is key, using your mouse or joystick aim your dynamite and throw it under your feet to blow yourself up and around obstacles to reach your goal. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An empty world.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself alone in this strange world, it is up to you to explore and understand the complexities of your existence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunning.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from hours to progress just a small amount, to finishing the game in minutes, use the built-in speedrun mode to measure your time and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/extras/c0994642cde3d3970d6dfc6dfdb7c9dc.poster.avif?t=1749491697\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/extras/c0994642cde3d3970d6dfc6dfdb7c9dc.webm?t=1749491697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co